OL,3,GNEWSASpecial send-off for ferry after
OL,4,A49 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry which has taken more than 5.3
OL,7,Fmillion passengers between Cornwall and
OL,8,Fthe Isles of Scilly is being given a
OL,9,Fspecial send-off as it retires from
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FThe Scillonian III started carrying
OL,13,Fpassengers in 1977 and is making its
OL,14,Flast voyage on Sunday, 8 November, with
OL,15,Fa special service on board and a
OL,16,Fflotilla escorting the vessel.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
