OL,3,GNEWSASpecial send-off for ferry after
OL,4,A49 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring its final voyage the crew will
OL,7,Fseal a special time capsule, filled
OL,8,Fwith contributions from people who have
OL,9,Ftaken voyages on the ship, to mark its
OL,10,F10,800 journeys over the last 49 years.
OL,11,FThe time capsule's final resting point
OL,12,Fis yet to be revealed.
OL,14,FDonations include photographs, pieces
OL,15,Fof memorabilia, artwork and keepsakes.
